#: pages/templates/pages/a_propos.html:80
msgid "Notre histoire"
msgstr "Our story"

#: pages/templates/pages/a_propos.html:85
msgid ""
"Numeria Institute est né d'une simple observation : l'Afrique subsaharienne "
"vit une transformation numérique accélérée, avec une jeunesse nombreuse et "
"ambitieuse, mais une absence criante de formation pratique en sciences "
"computationnelles et intelligence artificielle."
msgstr ""
"Numeria Institute was born from a simple observation: Sub-Saharan Africa is "
"experiencing an accelerated digital transformation, with a large and "
"ambitious youth population, but a glaring lack of practical training in "
"computational sciences and artificial intelligence."

#: pages/templates/pages/a_propos.html:88
msgid "Basé à "
msgstr "Based in "

#: pages/templates/pages/a_propos.html:88
msgid ""
", au cœur de l'Afrique de l'Ouest, Numeria Institute a été fondé avec une "
"vision claire : devenir le hub de référence pour la formation technologique "
"appliquée pour l'ensemble de la région CEDEAO."
msgstr ""
", in the heart of West Africa, Numeria Institute was founded with a clear "
"vision: to become the reference hub for applied technology training for the "
"entire ECOWAS region."

#: pages/templates/pages/a_propos.html:91
msgid ""
"Notre approche est unique : nous combinons rigueur académique et projets "
"ancrés dans les réalités africaines — agriculture, santé, énergie, finance "
"inclusive — pour former des experts capables de créer des solutions à fort "
"impact local."
msgstr ""
"Our approach is unique: we combine academic rigor with projects rooted in "
"African realities — agriculture, health, energy, inclusive finance — to "
"train experts capable of creating high-impact local solutions."

#: pages/templates/pages/a_propos.html:105
msgid "Vision & Mission"
msgstr "Vision & Mission"

#: pages/templates/pages/a_propos.html:113
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Progression"
msgid "Notre Vision"
msgstr "Progress"

#: pages/templates/pages/a_propos.html:115
msgid ""
"Devenir, d'ici 2030, le principal institut de formation en sciences "
"computationnelles et intelligence artificielle appliquée en Afrique de "
"l'Ouest francophone, produisant des experts capables de modéliser, analyser "
"et résoudre les problèmes complexes du continent."
msgstr ""
"To become, by 2030, the leading training institute in computational sciences"
" and applied artificial intelligence in French-speaking West Africa, "
"producing experts capable of modeling, analyzing and solving the continent's"
" complex problems."

#: pages/templates/pages/a_propos.html:122
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Progression"
msgid "Notre Mission"
msgstr "Progress"

#: pages/templates/pages/a_propos.html:124
